# Music: keep the generation pipeline (music/generate/) and the current
# finished masters (music/v5_mp3/) in git -- both are small and are what let
# someone continue this work on another machine. Everything else here is a
# large, disposable intermediate: raw WAV renders on the way to those MP3s,
# older exploratory passes (v2-v4), and a downloaded third-party reference
# track that isn't ours to redistribute.
music/Sample Music/
music/wav/
music/mp3/
music/v2_wav/
music/v3_wav/
music/v3_mp3/
music/v4_wav/
music/v4_mp3/
music/v5_wav/
# v5_mp3 is kept for history; v6_ogg is what ships.
